{"speciesId":591,"names":{"fr":"Gaulet","es":"Amoonguss","en":"Amoonguss","ja":"モロバレル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il danse en faisant tournoyer les coupoles en forme de Poké Ball de ses bras pour attirer ses proies."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It lures prey close by dancing and waving its arm caps, which resemble Poké Balls, in a swaying motion."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il se sert de ses coupoles en forme de Poké Ball pour attirer ses proies, mais peu de Pokémon se laissent avoir."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They show off their Poké Ball caps to lure prey, but very few Pokémon are fooled by this."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It moves the caps on both arms and does a dance to lure prey. It prefers damp places."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It moves the caps on both arms and does a dance to lure prey. It prefers damp places."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se sert de ses coupoles en forme de Poké Ball pour attirer ses proies, mais peu de Pokémon se laissent avoir."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Aunque intenta pasar por parte superior de una Poké Ball para atraer a sus presas, consigue engañar a pocos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They show off their Poké Ball caps to lure prey, but very few Pokémon are fooled by this."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"モンスターボールの カサを 見せつけ 獲物を 誘き寄せようとするが だまされる ポケモンは 少ない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il danse en faisant tournoyer les coupoles en forme de Poké Ball de ses bras pour attirer ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Baila meciendo rítmicamente los dos brazos a modo de Poké Ball para hacer que sus presas se acerquen."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lures prey close by dancing and waving its arm caps, which resemble Poké Balls, in a swaying motion."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"両腕の モンスターボールに 似た カサを ゆらゆらと 動かして 獲物を 誘う ダンスを 